<script setup lang="ts">import { ref } from 'vue'; import type { Candidate } from '../api/contracts'; defineProps<{ candidates:Candidate[]; count:number; busy:boolean }>(); defineEmits<{ confirm:[reason:string]; cancel:[] }>(); const reason=ref('');</script>
<template><div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="duplicate-title" class="dialog"><h2 id="duplicate-title">同一人物候補の確認</h2><p>全{{count}}件、最大20件を表示しています。</p><table><thead><tr><th>学籍番号</th><th>氏名</th><th>生年月日</th><th>クラス</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="c in candidates" :key="c.studentId"><td>{{c.studentNo}}</td><td>{{c.studentName}}</td><td>{{c.birthDateWareki}}</td><td>{{c.classLabel}}</td></tr></tbody></table><label>確認理由 ※必須<textarea v-model="reason" maxlength="120"></textarea></label><div class="actions"><button autofocus :disabled="busy" @click="$emit('cancel')">取消</button><button type="button" :disabled="busy || !reason.trim()" @click="$emit('confirm',reason)">別人と確認して続行</button></div></div></template>
